# Keep heavy / secret / generated artifacts out of the AI context.
# gitignore-style patterns, applied recursively (any depth).

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Next.js builds and other build output
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/

# Lock files (huge, useless to the model)
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# Secrets and environment
.env*
**/.env*

# TypeScript build info
**/*.tsbuildinfo
